":"CH0061_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"（次は、先輩たちみんなと一緒に……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/vyDsqa9nCpbDAFCD2LEwc6TALbIoeTPJ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"（ここ、狙撃ポイントとして良さそうですね）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/acMwLWrZMZhPdbOOmkhIhdtz8U6zGDF0.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"（心は水面のように。揺れを徐々に、静かに……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jzrh7TSZUUNwK2hTstLpnSn9K1nvt4hv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_CommonSkill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"どうぞ、熱中症対策です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/tovXPgqaql5PPlF0AxLNLGtgEmPjEiah.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLobby_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"トリニティの他の方たちと海に来るなんて初めてで……少し、緊張してしまいますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/KGbv4Kqdwj4ugiFd8mgfo1tqJslT77oU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLobby_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"知者楽水……知恵ある者は水を楽しむ、と言います。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/tUbNr77NuCOd95WBy8rWfgj84YL6YKfV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLobby_3.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"（水着くらい、黒じゃなくても良かったかな……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/3co6TvLl0MmYK31K22dIv7RqSNjyp6BB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLobby_4.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"今、どこからかツルギ先輩の叫び声が……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/IUlgM6pvyoUSdtzGX0RdHs2D4BYA09ko.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLogin_1.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"今日も蒸し暑いですね……。熱中症には十分気をつけてください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7dKptobygXCdrdETg5zSDNVMeNuxbu3U.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventLogin_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"さあ、夏期特別訓練を始めましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7XgQqxSeYARLrOcLcfNrNhCVZb78PHCH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_EventMission_2.ogg","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"リゾート地でも、油断は禁物です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Zkx59fCHC2xReVK73Sz2MkNzsgAEjktN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はあ……休む暇もありませんね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/BW2FTNclsZS67DbnGZ45rlPFXr97XgMN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"せっかくの休息、楽しみにしていたのですが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/KU2rcXzyFi26YNxSFDfJGEOYqiPKSCea.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"飲み物を準備しておいて良かったです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/8B1vt2ePIRnh7GmixPdJRrMPcgrfntLg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"炭酸の飲み過ぎはダメですよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/PQoVYxEamP9yAveLTapkOTMzKle9AD0E.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"炭酸シャワーはいかがですか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/QjxVGIARW49QABczGAmW9vb22bGcJs7q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"悪はすべて洗い流します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/O7HuPFX1XYKdsay7Xkvzmyjzf5HRz5mk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"これもまた……真の正義……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/DglUs2Oob2rPDMzjyv7OBAxEItPVZjKn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"トリニティの正義実現委員会1年、マシロ。どんな場所でも、いついかなる状況でも、全力で先生のことを支援します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7fUNlPuqwjFWslga9XiBvddpC0cHUgre.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"任務も休息も、しっかりとやります。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/W3l1ZFLn9hF7DSxi9lMZrp7QX6GeD4u9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"やはり先生に教えていただくと、分かりやすいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/6TYMbKUzoHjZqH9nJ070LOheiYXuKYfW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"今回も充実した訓練でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/UvLZNDZ5NATVGFyZhFvqGsE3xd6CItt7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"これが、正義の力……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/dpWYKHTrNfZ6hHb2yjxIkTOqA00fLysN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"出撃の時間ですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/W14S3HsjhPsnnAuMAti15wtwLa7A47vb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"どんな場所であっても、正義は不変です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/vtUjIBKHh7nCAWIdaGCu734fYieIgCcv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"可愛い水着は正義……。 なるほど、心に刻みます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/fGiR62RxA5UX0UtwLLAjE68Sop4sXSiT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……これですか？普通のアイスキャンディーですよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/woYs7qm586gAJOwSgcJKqNloNf4BtNge.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私の食べかけでもよろしければ……食べますか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/NMRKNVgx1TF8ruFmfrAhn6y1FBK4cbT5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"おかえりなさい、先生。今日の訓練は何をしましょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/okTnyC9u2CiaQlitGOqz9tELcqgbTKlo.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お待ちしておりました、先生。すぐに遊びに…… い、いえ、訓練に行きましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/O9lmZoqH2Fju8RT5RvU9EdXTuVeObzVI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生はアイスキャンディー、噛んで食べる派ですか？ それとも舐める派ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/5ZVm3PCNpQMjRkTbWojT5Oi7gKiGqQ8D.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私は、ゆっくり舐めて食べる派です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/adJeU5tzJyFyZn48ZfvdFvfLoQkFQGXm.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"その方が、アイスキャンディーの味を長く楽しめますから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cQA8vizK4och7fAQWUvK3ZZuwKFunktw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"はむっ…… ぺろっ、れろっ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/myFjt28388p0sz6Ngdt4E1g3OLNn1OZC.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……はい？ 食べ方がちょっと……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cVD3gxA5KRhg4kE8RcRP6b4cclp0TJKr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私としては、いつも通りなのですけど…… 何か変でしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/XUr2evkQVNLQMVcdJUI3ho1fRDSAiOLY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_MemorialLobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……先生？なんだかまた、変な表情をされてる気がするのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/h44Dja01yx8Jv2j8RZOU4WfNKtLjUB7d.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生と一緒ですと、このような強い日差しも気持ちよく感じられますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bE6O5e1v2aVuF7AyfQuQpPmLah56Cbir.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"素敵な海辺……。こんな所に連れてきてくれて、ありがとうございます。やはり先生は正義のお方ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/9OSqzp6EAwMR4d8peCdUe9SAVJH2Ynbq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生、またこの前の海辺まで遊びに行きませんか？せ、正義にも時には休息が必要なので！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Ok1xiasnBLmwcbSmzp8lsh4vcOTk9JlH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生。えっと……その……ア、アイスキャンディ一緒に食べますか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/60hTqdepDN3xuM5rCdbIBeWiWd8LujgJ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"誕生日プレゼント、ですか？そうですね… 先生と一緒にアイスキャンディーを食べられれば、それで充分です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/E7FQHWkIB6JzHeHARUIlZptRhRrVQZdj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。 先生の今日という日が完璧なものになるように、私がすぐ隣で密着警護します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ey9i6At8uDxKEJWoiQPyFBy6p7FnOcPW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"学食で出てくるあの、温かいかぼちゃスープが恋しくなる季節ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/GAtNJ3VJ7AFwxRrXIwpr3R3sqrd7dNTD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます。今年の夏の訓練も、楽しみにしていますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/gIgu4AKobIyVp38LhboxlJHszIM32wpB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0061_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いつの間に、夏が過ぎてクリスマスに…… 楽しい時間が経つのは早いですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/8YmiQfNnZliv74p6jmn28S5NX9NZaHyz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cardgame_act_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"そうです。正義は不滅です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0061_cardgame_act_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cardgame_act_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"お預けになっていた勝負…ここで決着をつけましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0061_cardgame_act_2.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0061_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您来了。今天训练什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/8BjmsF0Jx75dZybrM63npPjfxHxxQNvU.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"我正等您呢，老师。快去玩水…… 啊不对，快去训练吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/redWTesnOuftWVwSxbzYurzUu6BGs356.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师吃冰棒的时候，是喜欢咬着吃，还是喜欢舔着吃呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/yRZ9SsoCkvenKHeYHEOkJDCAL6dJf429.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"我喜欢慢慢地舔着吃。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/H7Z0jQXdfUtID4te0I9Yv5G7FGyJwrml.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为这样就能多享受一会儿冰棒的美味了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/UDzVirlPmljvLrH7qavIeDjRisM3VE4z.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"啊呜……嗯唔，嗯唔。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/WBKkZDqegbDu9G9iOpDpf33mrk8DKJDO.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？您说这种吃法很奇怪？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/OB2pGlGxdCkLwnEI0fpCTxAtvlfE5ZCZ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"我觉得很普通啊？哪里奇怪了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ckYSonk1004Bsl9AC0XYdrPZVKx7ggHk.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"老师……？怎么又露出了奇怪的表情呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/FHVCov8BZcDrz9M3cMw3zTCaQ54EvAlf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"只要和老师在一起，就算是在烈日下，我也感觉良好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Wu0PlJdxIywtK5vZyjtyzk1GOHGWBH2E.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"好漂亮的海滩啊，谢谢老师带我过来。不愧是老师，对正义了如指掌。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/IVkTr79Y6ez6UsyQKyKwtmvZtRtQ6YXw.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，要不要去那边的沙滩玩玩？正，正义有时候，也需要休息的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7DxNuwOz0yxgYJiei5dati68guUiZpnP.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"嗯，老师，要……要不要……一起吃冰棒啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Lvub9z9zjhFpAcaUYi8aj7eHxSqZfWXl.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"想送我生日礼物？这样啊…… 不过不用了，能跟老师一起吃冰棒就足够了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/QNAHFdTN6vNsJC9LFbyxGXzi3lvDwDxw.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。 我会贴身保护老师，保证让您度过完美的一天。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/8dQp4jLMVWFLSbkXchuHSjWRVqYi4m4e.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新，新春穿这样的衣服，会不会很奇怪……啊，您觉得很好？那就好……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/GYqRbEJSQYwwLItcModYCZwq93VqRnZC.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"一到这个季节，就好怀念学生食堂卖的热乎乎的南瓜汤啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7cinGxzh9SlaExSPzCqoo3jet4uKUTD7.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您中秋节快乐！冰皮月饼很美味呢，您来尝尝吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/swACR17Tvlf6lV3coJ8n75pRxtcUZd2A.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐。我很期待今年的夏训哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/BbGC3SUmvDcj7y3GMUGqMjNwOQatzFiJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"不知不觉夏天就过去了，圣诞节都到了…… 快乐的时间总是很短暂呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/gskTiq1ZZ8y3sRgBbmdqtj8c71NfVnQK.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/OcUYQihZL8ImEuVMZlhzsy8w8WDK7W0h.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"感觉有什么可疑的目光……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/RBcA8fl2lI4kaflJaFfWTC6HvyMGF8Mk.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这里应该不会有问题儿童试图闹事吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/mmUcEuShTwfoFm2jRGrXBQcWDGizgycp.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"（下次跟前辈们一起来好了……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/NlXOwPWLadXvNUs2IHPCv0JEFBbpcwQr.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（这地方正好可以当狙击点呢。）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/tkqCcV8Ialb2vkggMAS1fJROQtPeXL5J.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（心如止水……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ADCn5IflomyVKuc3bkUUgGyF4P2Gn4AJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"给，可以预防中暑。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/LExDDLQKXDRHfe3SALhJ6RXSntGdxpBe.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"这是我第一次和崔尼蒂的其他学员一起来海边……有点紧张呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/qeCctr8lz1tQFdzAyNWsWT20XUKUTERQ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"有句话叫智者乐水……意思是说，聪明的人都喜欢水。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ph66mDmvbboPIBi0VEh0rER1nYtBpc3P.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"（泳装是不是不用买黑色的啊……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/GX0oJTVxnKCfBABpfiMLE7FQ6u6q1s4C.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"……我刚才好像听到鹤城前辈在哪儿大喊大叫……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Ng9EhXTxd4DkyKXMNqCyFzRZ3tlVYwFH.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"今天也好热啊。请小心不要中暑了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/V8hIlwMVxNpnNjLcDjZCsml7H3Inxf99.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"好，现在开始夏季特别训练！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/vFJPcYLnAXaB2KmmhpaQ1x7eKrA5ZzZv.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"真是一点休息的时间都没有啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/baQ29sE31zGYVsisT5WCKmkOWUcYgayz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"难得休个假，本来很期待的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/MPFMbF5fKYYB1NkwEfdOEbquFiXYffsC.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"还好提前准备了饮料。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/v8HaXc3d9C5T44WJdk1qmvfs1Mdz9Vy4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"碳酸饮料可不能喝太多哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/yuTi6jivYfOa9lmKSrpscDD1hEMp8m6E.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"要不要用碳酸洗个澡？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/URxOp3PeEzJLzFkha6czFFllYOaWB55Y.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"我会洗刷掉所有的邪恶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/QJpXwsrHMYyeD5RjTbKqC359vtJnndpK.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"这才是……真正的正义……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kfq1KZ2Ru88lkEwB9fteZutEBzlkbeWV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"又有什么情况了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/7GsTNnZnTTuYRbOLBoHzr8Smcml09Qgu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"在度假地也不能掉以轻心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/BK5ecV82H3wpgVONhjQQofShIVjJfMpK.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是崔尼蒂正义实现部的新人，真白。无论什么地点，无论什么情况，我都会全力支援老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Lnc05DDlvW7p5lXm5lNCV4kZjbwfkjYM.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"我会做到张弛有度的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/iQmYxRaJ0l8P7kNFeZngwoHj4IyhNnIa.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"老师的教导就是简单易懂。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/DpSbmivqCinNwc8MGSiMCjj5L329wMbu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"这次的训练也好充实啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/koB2zLRXBvU1zKgUA5GUBgGbhXFnXiYF.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"这，就是正义的力量。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Ma0uN92umEf4GCeylRztESpi5h2s8jDb.ogg"},{"description":"ch0061_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"终于要出击了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kSZPWa